model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway.accountTargets {
    metadata {
      constraint "Device-bound accounts retain revision-checked target metadata and refuse execution before cloud credentials are resolved. Hosted and local HTTP contracts and clients preserve offline and unavailable errors. Legacy upgrade fixtures remove account targets before restoring older schema versions and assert the current storage version. Embedded MCP Apps assets must match the account target contract. Device execution requires a separate authenticated host and explicit access grants. Account acquisition and removal retain the saved target revision through their normal SDK paths; a client-side online indicator cannot substitute for target validation."
    }
  }
}
